# Tempoross: "The storm is out of control!" is a warning, not the end. A game saved after it and
# subdued is kept as won with its points and permits; a game whose storm reaches 100% is lost with
# its points.
#
# Before the fix, the message alone marked the game washed away: subdued after it, the game was
# kept as lost with 0 points and 0 permits.
#
# Facts:
#  - OSRS wiki, Tempoross/Strategies: "Tempoross has gathered too much energy. The storm is out of
#    control!" comes after three energy rounds; the encounter then fails "unless at least two
#    cannons have enough fish loaded to force Tempoross to submerge again"
#  - OSRS wiki, Tempoross: if storm intensity hits 100% before Tempoross is subdued the encounter
#    fails and the points are lost
#  - permits: one for the first 2,000 points and one more each 700 beyond (OSRS wiki, Tempoross)
include /replays/scenes/tempoross.scene
skill FISHING 60
items INV HARPOON 1
at 3040 2990
tick
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Tempoross has gathered too much energy. The storm is out of control!"
widget TemporossHud.STORM_INTENSITY_TITLE text "Storm Intensity: 92%"
widget TemporossHud.POINTS_TEXT text "Points: 4,350"
tick
widget TemporossHud.ESSENCE_TITLE text "Essence: 0%"
npc TEMPOROSS_INSTANCE_HOST_E_VICTORY "Spirit Angler" 3044 2990 as host
tick
widget TemporossHud.CONTENT hidden true
tick
expect saved.tempoross.games ~ ",4350,4,1"

# Next game: the storm reaches 100% and washes everyone away. The points are lost.
widget TemporossHud.CONTENT hidden false
widget TemporossHud.ESSENCE_TITLE text "Essence: 60%"
widget TemporossHud.STORM_INTENSITY_TITLE text "Storm Intensity: 50%"
widget TemporossHud.POINTS_TEXT text "Points: 900"
remove host
tick 60
widget TemporossHud.STORM_INTENSITY_TITLE text "Storm Intensity: 100%"
tick
widget TemporossHud.CONTENT hidden true
tick
expect saved.tempoross.games ~ ",0,0,0"
